    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"7309\" data-end=\"7338\">Level 18 — <strong data-start=\"7323\" data-end=\"7338\">Final Quiet</strong></h2><p data-start=\"7340\" data-end=\"7366\">You end escalation itself.</p><h3 data-start=\"7368\" data-end=\"7390\">Once per Soma Break</h3><p data-start=\"7391\" data-end=\"7424\">Create a 6 squares zone for 1 minute:</p><ul data-start=\"7425\" data-end=\"7563\"><li data-start=\"7425\" data-end=\"7445\"><p data-start=\"7427\" data-end=\"7445\">Morale cannot rise</p></li><li data-start=\"7446\" data-end=\"7465\"><p data-start=\"7448\" data-end=\"7465\">Inspiration fails</p></li><li data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7518\"><p data-start=\"7468\" data-end=\"7518\">Buffs tied to hope, unity, or courage do not apply</p></li><li data-start=\"7519\" data-end=\"7563\"><p data-start=\"7521\" data-end=\"7563\">Enemies roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on checks vs fear</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"7565\" data-end=\"7575\">Afterward:</p><ul data-start=\"7576\" data-end=\"7672\"><li data-start=\"7576\" data-end=\"7602\"><p data-start=\"7578\" data-end=\"7602\">Your Burn drops to <strong data-start=\"7597\" data-end=\"7602\">0</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"7603\" data-end=\"7672\"><p data-start=\"7605\" data-end=\"7672\">You gain <strong data-start=\"7614\" data-end=\"7653\">2 Burn at the end of the next round</strong> (delayed backlash)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"7674\" data-end=\"7701\">Victories here feel hollow.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
